cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Idem: Deterministic Drift Detection for LLM APIs"
abstract: >-
  Idem is an open-source CLI tool that detects when an LLM's response
  to a fixed set of test questions has changed from an approved
  baseline, catching cases where a vendor silently updates or swaps
  the model behind a stable API name.
authors:
  - family-names: Sharma
    given-names: Sumit
repository-code: "https://github.com/acekapila/idem"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-05"
keywords:
  - llm
  - ai-governance
  - model-drift
  - llm-testing
  - ai-audit
